ALWAYS wield something when you are fighting a cockatrice if you don't have
gloves. (even an egg!). If you want to find out if there is a cadaver, 
move to that spot without picking up (ie with the 'm' command), and
drop something on it. Then pickup (','). It will say
Pick up a thingy? [ynaq] (say no)
Pick up a cockatrice cadaver [ynaq] (say no if you're not wearing gloves)

If you are, wield it. It's the best weapon you'll ever find in ordinary hack.
In my version, you can eat the monsters you hit with it, which is surprising
as it says "You hit the hobgoblin with the cockatrice cadaver. It turns to
stone!" but you can eat the dead hobgoblin. It should REALLY I think be a
pile of rocks.

According to a file that I have on rumours, the rumour that
"dead lizards protect against cockatrices" is not true.

So just find some gloves or wish for a +3 pair of gloves and fight away.

