SPOILER -

Where you see "ad er um um" or something engraved on the floor, that is
where the leprachaun's secret teleport trap to the vault is for that level.
So when you see it, seach around. It will ALWAYS be next to a wall. A door
appears in the wall (ie you find one), and walking into it and searching 
some more will find a teleport trap that teleports you to the vault for
that level.

I worked that out myself. Please try to keep the applause down.


